769
00:26:28,075 --> 00:26:31,134
receive roughly one thousand four hundred dollars

770
00:26:31,134 --> 00:26:32,820
if they claim at sixty two,

771
00:26:32,820 --> 00:26:35,567
and roughly two thousand four hundred eighty

772
00:26:35,567 --> 00:26:38,065
