773
00:26:38,065 --> 00:26:39,002
is sixty seven.

774
00:26:39,182 --> 00:26:41,427
That's a difference of more than one

775
00:26:41,427 --> 00:26:42,986
thousand dollars a month,

776
00:26:42,986 --> 00:26:45,045
for life, adjusted for inflation.

777
00:26:45,394 --> 00:26:46,207
Try this.

778
00:26:46,387 --> 00:26:49,139
Check your Social Security statement to see

779
00:26:49,139 --> 00:26:51,955
