841
00:28:59,418 --> 00:29:01,658
This is when you decide which layers

842
00:29:01,658 --> 00:29:02,592
you'll rely on,

843
00:29:02,592 --> 00:29:04,770
and start building them on purpose.

844
00:29:05,120 --> 00:29:06,932
In your sixties and beyond,

845
00:29:06,932 --> 00:29:09,550
the focus shifts from growing assets to

846
00:29:09,550 --> 00:29:11,227
drawing income from them.

847
00:29:11,407 --> 00:29:13,885
Deciding when to claim Social Security,

848
00:29:13,885 --> 00:29:15,855
whether an annuity makes sense,

849
00:29:15,855 --> 00:29:17,634
how much to keep in cash and

850
00:29:17,634 --> 00:29:20,049
bonds, and setting up a steady monthly

851
00:29:20,049 --> 00:29:21,891
paycheck from your portfolio.

852
00:29:22,241 --> 00:29:23,735
Imagine two investors,

853
00:29:23,735 --> 00:29:26,518
each with three hundred thousand dollars,

854
00:29:26,518 --> 00:29:28,418
each wanting monthly income.

855
00:29:28,598 --> 00:29:31,083
The first chases the highest yields they

